<p>A short, sourced round-up of the technology news that matters to engineering and product leaders, with my view on each. This first edition covers 26 to 28 October 2026.</p>

<figure class="dgm">
<div class="dgm-stack">
<div class="dgm-tier"><small>Rules</small><div class="dgm-nodes"><span class="hl">India frontier AI law<em>consultation expected</em></span></div></div>
<div class="dgm-tier"><small>Vendors</small><div class="dgm-nodes"><span class="hl">Anthropic S-1<em>risk disclosures</em></span><span>Intel and Classiq<em>quantum software</em></span></div></div>
<div class="dgm-tier"><small>Models</small><div class="dgm-nodes"><span class="hl">GPT-6.1 Terra<em>cheaper computer use</em></span></div></div>
